Revision history for Test::Slim

1.00 2026-10-18
    First public release candidate. Provides a Perl SLiM v0.5 server with
    FitNesse-managed pipe and TCP transports, Perl fixture construction and
    method dispatch, symbols, and metadata-driven argument and result
    conversion for supported scalar, enum, array, and collection types.
    Includes FitNesse integration tests, independent installed-distribution
    checks, and a business-oriented order-management example. Requires Perl
    5.36.0 or later. This entry records release-candidate preparation; it is
    not a publication date or release announcement.
